        "title": "Say circumstances allow it",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use 能 when ability or circumstances make an action possible. Someone may know how to do it but be unable to do it now.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我会开车，今天不能开车。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ huì kāichē ， jīntiān bù néng kāichē 。",
                "meaning": "I know how to drive, but I cannot drive today.",
